    "description": "<b>Get The Big Day and start planning your wedding today. Design your personal countdown, manage your to-do lists, spendings, guests and timetables in one app. It's a perfect tool for all DIY brides.</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc95<b>The Big Day Highlights</b> \ud83d\udc95\r\n\u2714\ufe0fCreate and personalize multiple event countdowns your own photo\r\n\u2714\ufe0fManage your to-dos and tasks with the check lists\r\n\u2714\ufe0fTrack your wedding guests and create a seating sheet\r\n\u2714\ufe0fSchedule your wedding day with the timeline functionality\r\n\u2714\ufe0fKeep track of your wedding expenses with the budget planner\r\n\u2714\ufe0fInvite your partner\r\n\u2714\ufe0fGet notified about the remaining time until your wedding\r\n\u2714\ufe0fUse our free countdown widget for your home screen\r\n\u2714\ufe0fSimple and clear interface\r\n\u2714\ufe0fGuaranteed no ads\r\n\r\n<b>And this is how it works</b> \ud83c\udf89\r\nJust enter your planned wedding date and your name to start your personal wedding countdown. Choose colors, fonts, and background images to make the countdown YOUR wedding countdown. This way you know exactly how many days, hours, minutes and seconds are left. The only thing you have to do, is to say \"I do\"!\r\n\r\n<b>Share the moment</b> \u23f1\r\nCount down the days until your wedding and share it with your friends and family. The built-in sharing lets you instantly share a beautiful snapshot of your countdown with your loved ones.\r\n\r\n<b>All your to-dos in one app</b> \u2705\r\nUse the check list to track your to-dos, with built in categories like budget, venue, styling or decoration. Complete pre-defined tasks or create your own, and highlight all the things which are important for you! Additionally you can move and re-order tasks to fit your needs and prioritization.\r\n\r\n<b>Manage your guests with the guest list</b> \ud83d\udc6f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\r\nCurate your personal guest list in the app. Tag your guests by groups and tables and keep track of the RSVP state of all your guests.\r\n\r\n<b>Your wedding day as a timeline</b> \ud83d\uddd3\r\nUse the timeline to plan your wedding or other important events ahead. Add activities and special occasions to your timeline in advance and be relaxed on your Big Day.\r\n\r\n<b>Control your budget</b> \ud83d\udcb8\r\nKeep an eye on your budget with the expenses planner. After you have entered your wedding budget, you can add and categorize your expenses. This way you know which item is the most expensive one or how much money is left. With this tool, your DIY wedding will never run out of money.\r\n\r\n<b>Invite your partner</b> \ud83d\udc69\u200d\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udc68\r\nInvite your loved ones to the app to organize your wedding together. Because who wants to plan their big day alone? The app will automatically synchronize all  your data across different devices. \r\n\r\n<b>Aesthetic widget</b> \ud83d\udd32\r\nAdd our free countdown widget to your home screen to see the remaining time until your wedding. You can even use your own photo and choose from three different widget layouts and sizes.\r\n\r\nYou have feedback about the app or want to share some wedding pics with us? ;-) Feel free to get in touch via cookieandcode+support@gmail.com",
